name: Antimatter — extra joker slot
author: corpus
description: >-
  Antimatter adds +1 Joker slot. Tier-2 voucher: requires Blank bought first, so the earliest
  practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: extra joker slot, more jokers, Stencil slot,
  Baseball Card density, best voucher payoff.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Antimatter
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: JokerStencil
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: BaseballCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
